OL,3,GNEWSASacked Grand Theft Auto worker
OL,4,Aclaims Rockstar staff placed on 'watch
OL,5,Alist'
OL,6,
OL,7,FA worker dismissed by the makers of
OL,8,FGrand Theft Auto claimed colleagues
OL,9,Fwere placed on a "watch list" after
OL,10,Fsigning a petition about remote
OL,11,Fworking.
OL,13,FDayne Oram told an employment tribunal
OL,14,FRockstar North "kept an eye" on a small
OL,15,Fgroup of employees who were union
OL,16,Fmembers after the petition was handed
OL,17,Fto the company in the spring of 2023.
OL,19,FOram was among a number of employees
OL,20,Fclaiming to have been sacked by the
OL,21,Fgaming giant for attempting to unionise
OL,22,Fin October last year.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
