OL,6,
OL,7,FRockstar has denied those allegations
OL,8,Fat the employment tribunal in Glasgow
OL,9,Fand alleges workers were sacked for
OL,10,F"gross misconduct" following the
OL,11,Fsharing of confidential information in
OL,12,Fan online forum.
